      "label": "2. Matriks Eksekusi Masif (540 Batch Run, Seed=42)"
    },
    {
      "id": "g3",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 10,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 1160,
      "height": 290,
      "label": "3. Metrik Evaluasi & Uji Signifikansi Statistik (Bab III Subbab 3.5.1 & 3.5.3)"
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### 1A. Kontrol: Naive Random\n\n- Pemilihan lagu acak tanpa struktur waypoint maupun trajektori\n- Batas bawah (*lower bound*) kinerja"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 1B. Baseline: Gaur (2023/2024)\n`[Static-Point Matching]`\n\n- Replikasi 2-tahap KNN pada titik rata-rata $(\\bar{v}, \\bar{a})$ + fitur audio 12D PCA\n- Tanpa info trajektori 2 Hz"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 810,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 1C. Model Usulan (2 Konfigurasi)\n`[Meyes 2019; Bendada 2023]`\n\n- **Ablasi OFF** ($\\lambda_{\\mathrm{traj}} = 0$): hanya titik statis\n- **Ablasi ON** ($\\lambda_{\\mathrm{traj}} > 0$): *Trajectory Alignment* + $\\mathcal{BJC}$"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 2. Korpus & Split Terkontrol\n\n- DEAM 1.802 klip (*song-level holdout split*)\n- Penguncian `seed=42`\n- Jumlah kandidat $K$, bobot jarak, & pool sama persis untuk semua model"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 3. 6 Rute Kuadran (540 Batch Run)\n\n- **Diagonal:** Q3 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q1, Q2 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q4\n- **Horizontal:** Q1 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q2, Q3 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q4\n- **Vertical:** Q1 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q4, Q2 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q3\n- Variasi $K$, panjang $M$, & trial"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 4. Output Playlist per Model\n\n- 540 playlist per konfigurasi\n- Menyimpan koordinat `intro` & `outro` setiap pasang lagu $(L_j, L_{j+1})$"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### 5. Hitung 3 Metrik Objektif\n`[Bab III 3.5.1, Eq. 3.8 - 3.10]`\n\n- **Boundary Smoothness** ($\\mathcal{S}$): rata-rata lonjakan *outro-intro* (target turun $\\ge 15\\%$)\n- **Evenness Index** ($\\mathcal{E}$): variansi langkah\n- **Cumulative BJC** ($\\mathcal{CBJC}$): total penalti"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### 6. Uji Wilcoxon Signed-Rank\n`[Bab III 3.5.3 & 3.5.5]`\n\n- Uji non-parametrik berpasangan ($\\alpha = 0,05$)\n- Bandingkan Usulan vs Gaur & Ablasi ON vs OFF\n- Bukti kausalitas kontribusi modul trajektori"
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 7. Keputusan & Analisis Diagnostik\n\n- Jika $p < 0,05$ & $\\mathcal{S}$ turun $\\ge 15\\%$: hipotesis diterima\n- *Fallback*: analisis diagnostik per kuadran"
    }
  ],
